# libxml2, target native or cross: without the python module, ICU and readline of the image. The
# native build is xmllint, xmlcatalog and the XML catalog of the build machine
# (${INSTALL_SYSCONFDIR}/xml/catalog, where lfs/docbook-xml and lfs/docbook-xsl register) with the
# library of lfs/libxslt:native; the cross build is the library of the programs a cross build runs on
# the build machine (the ical-glib-src-generator of lfs/libical:cross)
PKG_DEPS=
CONF_FLAGS="--with-threads --without-python --without-icu --without-readline --without-history"
PKG_CHECK="grep -qx 'Version: ${PKG_VER}' ${INSTALL_LIBDIR}/pkgconfig/libxml-2.0.pc"
